          "description": "Whether you’re hunting for truffles with Maris the truffle pig, discovering what happens when a kangaroo, a python, an emu, and a dingo get tangled up in a tree together, helping a narwhal unstick a boot from her horn, having a fruit fight with a troop of monkeys, or simply settling in for a cup of hot tea at Makiko’s Cat Cafe, these five original stories from your friends at Yoto are sure to make your ears happy — whether they’re long like a bunny’s, or short like a cat’s!"
